        407.23687744140625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "ac618263b89da26f4028240cdabeccbe946b77216bf10a07cd317b21f4fda67c"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0757-block-0049",
      "order": 49,
      "text": "Refer for specialist assessment\nif the person has:\n• a sustained decrease in GFR of 25%\nor more and a change in GFR\ncategory or sustained decrease in\nGFR of 15 mL/min/1.73 m2 or more\nwithin 12 months\n• hypertension that remains poorly\ncontrolled despite the use of at\nleast 4 antihypertensive drugs at\ntherapeutic doses (see also\n‘Hypertension’ NICE clinical\nguideline 127)\n• known or suspected rare or genetic\ncauses of CKD\n• suspected renal artery stenosis\n",
      "bbox": [
        250.1708221435547,
        431.3988952636719,
        346.5248107910156,
        551.51318359375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "50cb5af559fbc88d0a15fc13d35aa984e28d283a21d1e6714e5d8befd2fd7f4d"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0757-block-0050",
      "order": 50,
      "text": "Refer for specialist\nassessment if the person\nhas any of the criteria\nin A2, or:\n• ACR 70 mg/mmol or more,\nunless known to be caused\nby diabetes and already\nappropriately treated\n• haematuria\n",
      "bbox": [
        355.02081298828125,
        431.40521240234375,
        428.7067565917969,
        498.52716064453125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "4f3c18546a1cb25ba80b249e688c168c26b48ee52f27ae53480de8007888fde2"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0757-block-0051",
      "order": 51,
      "text": "Manage in primary care according to recommendations\n",
      "bbox": [
        259.2668151855469,
        414.13720703125,
        415.2907409667969,
        421.2471923828125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "3b933a4bb7103245ed6834937019eb83a34c8878a0ad19eb30fd7b0f99ec04f4"
